Package: fpsim
Title: Compute Measures of Foreign Policy Similarity/Agreement
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Steven", "Miller",
                  email = "steve@svmiller.com", 
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4072-6263"))
Maintainer: Steven Miller <steve@svmiller.com>
Description: These are tools that allow users to compute various measures of
    similarity or association that one might see in the study of international
    relations. These include measures like Signorino and Ritter's S 
    (weighted/unweighted), Cohen's weighted kappa, and Scott's pi. These tools
    offer the ability to generate such estimates of dyadic foreign policy
    similarity for analyses in the study of international relations. They also
    offer interested students the ability to learn how these estimates are
    calculated.
